<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74688" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπωπ-ή</span></b> , ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽὄπωπἀ</span> poet. for
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψις,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a sight</i> or <i>view,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως ἤντησας ὀπωπῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.97
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>outward appearance,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετεβάλλετ᾽ ὀπωπάν</span> Erinn.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				9.1090.53
			</span></i> + <i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i> (p. xii), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				2.60
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sight, power of seeing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμαρτήσεσθαι ὀπωπῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.512
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>eyeball,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.109
			</span></i> : pl., ib.<i><span class="en">
				445
			</span></i> ; but, <i>eyes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.1023
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.1670
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.75
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
